{"id":"C8669cccea14e576dd566","zh":"轮轨分离","en":"wheel-rail separation","domain":"铁路动力学与方法","definition_zh":"车轮与钢轨接触关系发生脱离的状态。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"描述车辆—轨道动力分析中单侧或双侧车轮失去接触的状态，可借助相对位移辅助评价，或以接触力降至零识别。模型通过释放相应接触约束或切换耦合关系，描述脱离后的运动。","translation_note":"本词条含依据文献语境拟定的参考译名。","usage_variants":[{"id":"C8669cccea14e576dd566","zh":"轮轨分离","en":"wheel-rail separation","domain":"铁路动力学与方法","group_id":"Ha5b660694157aa7658e1","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"铁路动力学与方法 · Xu等（2019）"}],"designations":[{"id":"De40cb9a40d878128e7c0","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"轮轨分离"},{"id":"D601f503d8782bc29c423","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"wheel-rail separation"}],"sources":{"P018":{"id":"P018","title":"A three-dimensional dynamic model for train-track interactions","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2019","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2019.04.037","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 76, 443-465","label":"Xu等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-a-three-dimensional-dynamic-model-for-train-track-interactions"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S73e6bd8d7ed4b3f11241","source_id":"P018","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"Mostly important the difficulties in establishing dynamic equations of motion for train-track systems by matrix representations of wheel-rail separation and infinite length computation are properly solved.","citations":[{"source_id":"P018","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sa6919b7620064122f344","source_id":"P018","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"Train-track interactions Matrix formulation Wheel-rail separation Cyclic calculation method Train derailment Railway engineering a b s t r a c t This paper develops a novel three-dimensional (3-D) train-track interaction model, where the train is modelled as a group of multi-rigid-body vehicles connected by coupler and gear draft systems, and the tracks are modelled as ballastless tracks using finite element method, and finally the train and the tracks are integrated into an entire system by train-rail coupling matrices.","citations":[{"source_id":"P018","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C42c35188a55a4f32d39b","target_concept_id":"C42c35188a55a4f32d39b","target_zh":"无限长计算","target_en":"infinite length computation","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Caa072db2b4dcf56960b2","target_concept_id":"Caa072db2b4dcf56960b2","target_zh":"循环计算方法","target_en":"cyclic calculation method","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C5bad1be7e79c338aa451","target_concept_id":"C5bad1be7e79c338aa451","target_zh":"有限元法","target_en":"finite element method","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C157c85efbf042d81e2e9","target_concept_id":"C157c85efbf042d81e2e9","target_zh":"铁道工程","target_en":"railway engineering","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C1a9ab27c87b867a7f7b8","target_concept_id":"C1a9ab27c87b867a7f7b8","target_zh":"循环计算","target_en":"cyclic calculation","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cffb829c04e1247173d30","target_concept_id":"Cffb829c04e1247173d30","target_zh":"无砟轨道","target_en":"ballastless tracks","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C94f37b0a2ffcaefd0838","target_concept_id":"C94f37b0a2ffcaefd0838","target_zh":"牵引缓冲装置系统","target_en":"gear draft systems","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C4537d4389d1f80563c83","target_concept_id":"C4537d4389d1f80563c83","target_zh":"耦合矩阵","target_en":"coupling matrices","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[{"id":"C6fb46a27b98cd665b947","language":"en","text":"matrix representations of wheel-rail separation","source_id":"P018","page":1}],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P018","title":"A three-dimensional dynamic model for train-track interactions","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2019","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2019.04.037","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 76, 443-465","label":"Xu等（2019）","overview_slug":"2019-a-thre